ind":"announcement","title":"Summer Is Over, Welcome Autumn! 🍂","summary":"Hey everyone! 💚 As we get closer and closer to the release of Heidi's Legacy, we've been working hard to polish every little detail and get everything ready for launch!There's a lot we want to share with you in this devlog, so let's jump right in with some big news... 🎬 WE HAVE AN ANNOUNCEMENT TRAILER! We're super excited to finally share our brand-new announcement trailer!We've teamed up with an anime studio to create a special trailer that blends beautiful anime sequences with actual gameplay,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:33:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681298","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1839676055888539","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"🌿 June & July Devlog!","summary":"Hey everyone! 💚We'll be honest: June and July were so intense that we didn't stop long enough to write a Devlog. We've been heads-down, pushing to get a fully playable version of Heidi's Legacy from the very first scene to the final credits, and we got there!! So today we're catching up with a double Devlog, and there's a lot to cover! 🗺️ Zones 3 to 5: A Mountain Takes Shape This was an enormous amount of work: weeks of sculpting and level design across zones 3 to 5. The lake, the camping spot, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T15:21:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055888539","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1835236783563842","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"🌸 May Devlog!","summary":"Hey everyone! 💚May was a packed month for us! First things first, if you haven't seen it yet, we released a big demo update at the start of the Cozy Games Celebration. You can find the full changelog here. Beyond the demo, we kept ourselves busy and made a lot of progress on the full game. Here's what we've been up to! 📖 Acts 4 & 5 Are Written and In-GameThis is a big one. We finished writing and implementing the dialogues for both Act 4 and Act 5, which means a big part of the narrative arc of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T15:24:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783563842","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1833968530888541","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"update","title":"🐐 Demo Update - Cozy Games Celebration is Here!","summary":"Hey everyone! 💚We're thrilled to be part of the Cozy Games Celebration happening right now on Steam! To mark the occasion, we've been hard at work on a new demo update packed with visual improvements, new systems, and a bunch of fixes based on your feedback. Here's everything that's new:🎬 Visuals & AtmosphereThe opening cutscene with Heidi and Grandpa has been redone! The characters have a “boiling” animation, trees sway in the breeze, clouds drift across the sky, and the whole scene feels much ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T15:30:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530888541","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1831432155568603","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"April Devlog! 🕖","summary":"Hey everyone! 💚April was a big month on multiple fronts! A major overhaul of how time works in the game, quality-of-life improvements from your demo feedback, and a lot of progress on Act 3! ⏱️ Complete Rework of the Time SystemThis was the most significant change of the month, and one that directly came from demo feedback. Many of you found the time periods too restrictive, only being able to tend to the goats in the morning, or only crafting once in the afternoon felt limiting and sometimes fr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-30T15:20:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155568603","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1828894815559851","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"March Devlog! 🌲","summary":"Hey everyone! 💚March was a big month for us: our very first public demo launched on March 6th as part of the Women's Day Sale on Steam, and the response was wonderful. In one week, more than 2000 players explored the mountains with Heidi for the first time, and your feedback has already shaped a first round of updates. Thank you for playing and sharing your thoughts! 🐐 🛠️ Demo Fixes & ImprovementsWe made some updates to the demo: the most common feedback we received was about controls. We remove","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-03T10:12:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815559851","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1827626365753952","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update! 🐐","summary":"Hello everyone!On March 6th, we launched our very first demo for Heidi's Legacy as part of the Women's Day Sale on Steam - and wow, what a response! Hundreds of you explored the mountains with Heidi, herded goats, and shared your thoughts with us. We are incredibly grateful for every single review, comment, and piece of feedback. It truly means the world to a small team like ours. 💚We read everything carefully, and today we are releasing an update to the demo that directly addresses the most com","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-19T15:57:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365753952","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1826992588599621","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"February Devlog! 🦋","summary":"Hello everyone! February has been a big month for us as we sprinted toward the demo that we released on March 6th! A lot of work happened behind the scenes, but also plenty of things that players will directly feel when playing for the first time. Let’s take a look!A brand new look for Heidi 💆Last month we talked about how we reworked the goats’ animations. This month, we did the same for Heidi herself!We modernized her whole outfit, which meant updating her appearance everywhere: in-game, cutsc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-15T14:09:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588599621","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1824644522847668","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"January Devlog! 🌼","summary":"Hey everyone! It’s already half February, welcome to the January update for the game 🙈🐐 This month we focused on visuals, animation pipeline improvements, new characters, and heavy testing so we can get a big surprise ready... !🐐 Goats, revisited (big technical change)First off, we completely reworked how goats are rendered and animated! Previously we assembled and animated them in Blender using 3D skeletons, then imported those animations into the game, running in 3D in the world. This month we","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-17T13:57:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522847668","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1819386365125931","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"December Devlog! 🎄","summary":"Hey everyone 💚 Despite taking some much deserved rest over the vacation period, December was a big month for Heidi’s Legacy, packed with some meticulous work behind the scenes and a few visible upgrades we are excited to share with you!🏃‍♀️ 8-direction movement for AdèleA big part of December was dedicated to making Adèle move in 8 directions instead of 4!This sounds simple on paper, but it turned into a bit of a time consuming task. We had to draw all the missing body parts, duplicate and adapt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-06T15:34:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365125931","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1818752592133430","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"November Devlog! ☕","summary":"Hey everyone! 💚 Another cozy month has flown by, and we are excited to share what we have been working on for Heidi’s Legacy!More life through VFX We spent quite some time polishing visual effects across the game to make actions feel more satisfying. You can now see clearer feedback when goats munch on the right flowers, when a production mini game succeeds, and during the mushroom digging mini game. We still need to add more, these small touches are essential to any video game! A world full of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-15T16:39:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592133430","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1815580768297913","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"October Devlog! 🎡","summary":"Hey everyone! October was a packed month for us on Heidi’s Legacy, and we’re excited to share everything we’ve been working on behind the scenes. This update touches UI, gameplay, worldbuilding, and core systems. Lots of invisible but important progress!🎡 The Quest Wheel - small interface, BIG workOne of the biggest features we tackled this month is something we internally call the Quest Wheel. It’s a clean, simple interface that gathers all quests from all NPCs in one place, making it easier to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-07T15:31:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815580768297913","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1813674388974587","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"September Devlog! 🏔️","summary":"Hey everyone! 💚We’ve been hard at work bringing our cozy mountain game to life, and we can’t wait to share what we’ve been cooking (literally!)First off, we focused on the cooking mechanic, and its renowned chef Birgit!She now has her own hand-painted portrait and her lovely little corner of the mountain village is finished ✨She can now live surrounded by her adorable chickens! We drew them in Photoshop and animated them in Blender, doing our best to capture all their clucky charm. We also coded","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-17T15:22:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813674388974587","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1809235871587060","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"August Devlog! 🏔️","summary":"Hi everyone!August has been an incredible month for Heidi’s Legacy — from new features in the demo to our very first public showing at Gamescom! Let’s dive in.A Brand-New Recipe Mini-Game 🍄✨We’ve been working hard to implement a new recipe system for the demo, just in time for Gamescom! In this mini-game, you’ll combine 2, 3, or 4 ingredients by aligning them in the correct order to craft handmade goods. Bonus lines even give you extra items - so planning your moves carefully really pays off.It’","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-28T13:25:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1809235871587060","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1807332909532924","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"July Devlog! 🏔️","summary":"Hi everyone! 👋July has flown by, and we’ve been hard at work getting Heidi’s Legacy ready for the big stage: Gamescom 2025! 🎉 We’re thrilled to be part of the Indie Arena Booth (Hall 10.2), and that means a lot of preparation behind the scenes: printings for the booth, designing cards and stickers, scheduling meetings, and (of course) polishing the demo so it runs smoothly and bug-free for everyone who plays it in Köln ✨🐐 Bug Fixes: The Sliding SagaThis month, we tackled a series of physics bugs","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-06T09:39:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909532924","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1803527891706788","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"June Devlog! 🌿","summary":"Hi everyone! 👋June was a big month for us two at Humble Reeds, and we’re excited to share everything we’ve been working on for Heidi’s Legacy with you!📺 The Big RevealFirst things first — Heidi’s Legacy was officially announced during Wholesome Direct 2025! 🎉 We were so touched by the warm response and curiosity around our new project 💖 If you haven’t seen the announcement trailer yet, you can check it out here: 🚶‍♀️ Adele's Journey BeginsWe kicked off the month by working on the intro cutscene,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-02T15:05:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1803527891706788","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3589430-1801617199458607","game_id":"steam-3589430","kind":"announcement","title":"Fresh devlogs from the peaks 🗻 Follow for more!","summary":"Welcome! 💚 We’re Humble Reeds, a team of 2 French developers, and we’re excited to finally open this page following the Wholesome Direct 2025 game announcement and share our journey with you 🐐Our aim is to post regular devlogs right here, as well as document our progress with developing the game on our Discord server. So if you’re interested, hit the Follow button to get updates on development, behind the scenes sneak peeks, and exclusive content! We can’t wait to share more with you!See you soo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-07T13:18:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1801617199458607","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"ne